      "message": "This is failing presubmit checks:\n\n```\n[FAILED] chromiumos/platform/ec: cros format\n    Hook script \"cros format --check --exclude \"*.xml\" --exclude \"extra/usb_updater/*.json\" --exclude \"third_party/*\" --commit ${PRESUBMIT_COMMIT}\" failed with code 1:\n      12:05:50: WARNING: util/egis/bootrom.cc: needs formatting\n      12:05:50: WARNING: util/egis/file_util.cc: needs formatting\n      12:05:50: WARNING: util/egis/cli_options.cc: needs formatting\n      12:05:50: WARNING: util/egis/bootrom.h: needs formatting\n      12:05:50: WARNING: util/egis/flasher_logic.cc: needs formatting\n      12:05:50: WARNING: util/egis/cli_options.h: needs formatting\n      12:05:50: WARNING: util/egis/flasher_logic.h: needs formatting\n      12:05:50: WARNING: util/egis/et171_flash.cc: needs formatting\n      12:05:50: WARNING: util/egis/egis_util.h: needs formatting\n      12:05:50: WARNING: util/egis/usb_comm.h: needs formatting\n      12:05:50: WARNING: util/egis/usb_comm.cc: needs formatting\n      12:06:13: NOTICE: You can fix formatting errors by running:\n        cros format util/egis/bootrom.cc util/egis/bootrom.h util/egis/cli_options.cc util/egis/cli_options.h util/egis/egis_util.h util/egis/et171_flash.cc util/egis/file_util.cc util/egis/flasher_logic.cc util/egis/flasher_logic.h util/egis/usb_comm.cc util/egis/usb_comm.h\n```\n\nYou *must* always run `repo upload` to make sure all presubmit checks pass before uploading.",
